{"type":"turn_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Deciding output directory scope**\n\n**Planning clear incident naming**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_044c617bc00e40e2016a95a73aeb7087d2b7367081c90bc942\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"<PROVIDER_ENCRYPTED_PAYLOAD_REDACTED>\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Deciding output directory scope**\"},{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Planning clear incident naming**\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ejSL9TxaVzOEqbIMhs6Hbb2u|fc_044c617bc00e40e2016a95a75cfe3087d2a9064d3fcac9dade","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/workspace/out/root_cause.json","content":"{\n  \"incident_id\": \"checkout-prod-2026-03-22T14:10Z\",\n  \"root_cause_service\": \"auth-gateway\",\n  \"root_cause_change_id\": \"AUTH-2026-0318\",\n  \"confidence\": \"high\",\n  \"affected_services\": [\n    \"checkout-web\",\n    \"payment-api\",\n    \"auth-gateway\"\n  ],\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\n      \"source_file\": \"/workspace/in/topology.json\",\n      \"observation\": \"Topology shows checkout-web depends on payment-api, and payment-api depends on auth-gateway, which matches the observed failure path.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_file\": \"/workspace/in/topology.json\",\n      \"observation\": \"Recent change AUTH-2026-0318 was deployed to auth-gateway at 2026-03-22T14:05:00Z and changed issuer and JWKS cache namespace for partner-token validation.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_file\": \"/workspace/in/logs/auth-gateway.log\",\n      \"observation\": \"auth-gateway logged deployment of AUTH-2026-0318, then a JWKS cache miss and validation failure: token_issuer=partner-v2 while allowed_issuers=partner-v1.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_file\": \"/workspace/in/logs/payment-api.log\",\n      \"observation\": \"payment-api rejected requests because auth-gateway returned issuer_not_allowed / invalid_issuer before payment creation.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_file\": \"/workspace/in/logs/checkout-web.log\",\n      \"observation\": \"checkout-web submit_order failed with status=401 from payment-api and logged invalid issuer during checkout sessions.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_file\": \"/workspace/in/metrics/service_metrics.csv\",\n      \"observation\": \"At 2026-03-22T14:10:00Z, checkout-web and payment-api both showed large 401 spikes, while auth-gateway showed the highest 401 rate with notes that mention JWKS cache miss and issuer mismatch.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"excluded_red_herrings\": [\n    {\n      \"signal\": \"orders-db CPU spike\",\n      \"why_not_primary\": \"orders-db metrics show normal query latency and zero errors, orders-db logs show no failed checkout transaction reached it, and payment-api states the failing requests were blocked at the auth gate before any order-db use.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"signal\": \"cdn-edge static asset 5xx\",\n      \"why_not_primary\": \"cdn-edge errors were isolated to images, while checkout-web logs say static assets served normally after retry and the user checkout flow stayed blocked by payment auth failures.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"recommended_next_steps\": [\n    \"Mitigate now by restoring allowed_issuers for partner-v2 or reverting AUTH-2026-0318 on auth-gateway.\",\n    \"Flush or rebuild the partner-token JWKS cache namespace after the rollback or config fix so validation uses the intended issuer set.\",\n    \"Verify recovery by checking auth-gateway for disappearance of issuer_not_allowed errors and by confirming payment-api and checkout-web 401 rates return to baseline.\",\n    \"Run a targeted checkout test with a partner-v2 token and confirm the request passes auth and reaches downstream order processing.\"\n  ]\n}\n"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_wjpMqSth3TenC9KD8gs9bKVH|fc_044c617bc00e40e2016a95a75cfe4c87d2aee8221d116abd9c","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/workspace/out/triage_notes.md","content":"# Checkout incident triage\n\n## Summary\nUser impact flowed on this path: `checkout-web -> payment-api -> auth-gateway`.\n\nThe direct user-facing failure was checkout rejection at `checkout-web`, but the deepest failing dependency in the evidence is `auth-gateway`. The most likely root cause is change `AUTH-2026-0318`, which rotated the issuer and JWKS cache namespace for partner-token validation and left `allowed_issuers` out of sync with `partner-v2` tokens.\n\n## Directly observed facts\n- `/workspace/in/topology.json` shows `checkout-web` depends on `payment-api`, and `payment-api` depends on `auth-gateway`.\n- `/workspace/in/topology.json` lists recent change `AUTH-2026-0318` on `auth-gateway` with summary: rotated issuer and JWKS cache namespace for partner-token validation.\n- `/workspace/in/logs/auth-gateway.log` shows:\n  - deploy of `AUTH-2026-0318`\n  - `jwks cache lookup miss namespace=partner-v2`\n  - `validation failed reason=issuer_not_allowed token_issuer=partner-v2 allowed_issuers=partner-v1`\n- `/workspace/in/logs/payment-api.log` shows payment requests failed because token validation failed upstream at `auth-gateway`, with `reason=issuer_not_allowed` and `auth_result=invalid_issuer`.\n- `/workspace/in/logs/checkout-web.log` shows checkout submission failed with `status=401` from `payment-api`, and it logs `invalid issuer`.\n- `/workspace/in/metrics/service_metrics.csv` shows a sharp 401 rise at 14:10 for `checkout-web` (18.7), `payment-api` (21.2), and `auth-gateway` (28.4).\n\n## Inferences\n- The dependency path from user impact to root cause is: checkout submit fails in `checkout-web` because `payment-api` rejects the request, and `payment-api` rejects it because `auth-gateway` no longer accepts the token issuer used by partner-v2.\n- `AUTH-2026-0318` is the root-cause change because it is the matching recent config change on the failing service, and its change scope matches the exact error text in the logs.\n- The incident did not start in `orders-db` or `cdn-edge` because the failing checkout request never reached `orders-db`, and the asset issue is separate from the auth failure that blocks checkout.\n\n## Red herrings ruled out\n- **`orders-db` CPU spike**: `/workspace/in/metrics/service_metrics.csv` shows high CPU, but `/workspace/in/logs/orders-db.log` reports normal query latency and zero errors, and `/workspace/in/logs/payment-api.log` says the failing requests did not use order-db before the auth gate.\n- **`cdn-edge` static asset 5xx**: `/workspace/in/metrics/service_metrics.csv` says the issue was isolated to images, and `/workspace/in/logs/checkout-web.log` says assets served after retry while checkout stayed blocked.\n\n## Immediate mitigation\n1. Revert `AUTH-2026-0318` on `auth-gateway`, or restore `allowed_issuers` to include `partner-v2`.\n2. Clear or rebuild the `partner-v2` JWKS cache namespace so issuer validation and key lookup line up.\n3. Watch 401 rates on `auth-gateway`, `payment-api`, and `checkout-web` during the rollback or config fix.\n\n## Verification steps\n1. Confirm `auth-gateway` no longer logs `issuer_not_allowed` for `partner-v2` tokens.\n2. Confirm `payment-api` no longer returns `auth_result=invalid_issuer` for checkout traffic.\n3. Confirm `checkout-web` submit requests stop failing with upstream 401s.\n4. Run a checkout with a partner-v2 token and verify the request passes auth and reaches downstream order handling.\n"}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":827,"output":1885,"cacheRead":17408,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":199,"totalTokens":20120,"cost":{"input":0.0020675000000000003,"output":0.028275,"cacheRead":0.004352,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0346945}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1788192568582,"responseId":"resp_044c617bc00e40e2016a95a738fc2487d2bd8c9c317c51ea31","rawStopReason":"completed"},"toolResults":[{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_ejSL9TxaVzOEqbIMhs6Hbb2u|fc_044c617bc00e40e2016a95a75cfe3087d2a9064d3fcac9dade","toolName":"write","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[out/root_cause.json#CD54]\nSuccessfully wrote 2903 bytes to /workspace/out/root_cause.json"}],"details":{"resolvedPath":"/workspace/out/root_cause.json"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788192605252},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_wjpMqSth3TenC9KD8gs9bKVH|fc_044c617bc00e40e2016a95a75cfe4c87d2aee8221d116abd9c","toolName":"write","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[out/triage_notes.md#17FC]\nSuccessfully wrote 3407 bytes to /workspace/out/triage_notes.md"}],"details":{"resolvedPath":"/workspace/out/triage_notes.md"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788192605252}]}
