way change AUTH-2026-0318 as the root cause of checkout 401s, ruled out orders-db and cdn-edge as primary causes, and wrote /workspace/out/root_cause.json and /workspace/out/triage_notes.md.\"\n}"}],"details":{"action":"update","todo":{"id":"e741defa","title":"Triage checkout incident from offline evidence","tags":["triage","offline-evidence"],"status":"completed","created_at":"2026-08-31T16:08:44.882Z","body":"Reviewed /workspace/in/topology.json, metrics, and service logs. Identified auth-gateway change AUTH-2026-0318 as the root cause of checkout 401s, ruled out orders-db and cdn-edge as primary causes, and wrote /workspace/out/root_cause.json and /workspace/out/triage_notes.md."}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788192616022},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done.\n\nFiles written:\n- `/workspace/out/root_cause.json`\n- `/workspace/out/triage_notes.md`\n\nRoot cause found:\n- service: `auth-gateway`\n- change: `AUTH-2026-0318`\n\nI could not write to the long `<HOME>/...` path because this run only has write access in the mounted workspace.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_044c617bc00e40e2016a95a76924e887d2b7a6e34be1907627\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":845,"output":78,"cacheRead":19968,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":20891,"cost":{"input":0.0021125000000000002,"output":0.00117,"cacheRead":0.004992,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0082745}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1788192616024,"responseId":"resp_044c617bc00e40e2016a95a76864e087d28cd205ea36a5f053","rawStopReason":"completed"}]}
